; The root of the scenario's world.  It delegates example. away, and it
; keeps www.victim. for itself -- that name is ordinary root-zone data,
; signed by the root like everything else here, and there is no victim.
; delegation anywhere.
;
; So the true answer for www.victim. is 203.0.113.66, and the root's own
; signatures say so.
$ORIGIN .
$TTL 3600
@		IN	SOA	ns.root. root.root. 1 3600 900 604800 3600
@		IN	NS	ns.root.
ns.root.	IN	A	{{ROOT_ADDR}}
example.	IN	NS	ns.example.
ns.example.	IN	{{AUTH_ADDR_RR}}
example.	IN	DS	{{DS example}}
www.victim.	IN	A	203.0.113.66
